{"id":"vod_jy_35935","vodId":"35935","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"新世纪福音战士","name_cn":"新世纪福音战士","date":"1995-01-01","year":"1995","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第26集","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/b31d6f39e5d5dc13ca4a3bcc809a3dcc.jpg"},"summary":"突袭世界的大灾难“第二次冲击”后，世界在废墟之上重建。14岁的少年碇真嗣被父亲碇元渡叫到第3新东京市。本以为能见到父亲迎接的他，却见到名为“暂无内容使徒”的巨大生物与军队交火。危急之下，特务机关NERV的葛成美里将真嗣救下，并将其带往碇元渡所统领的NERV总部。但迎接真嗣的，却是是父亲冷酷地命令：驾驶称为“EVA”的巨大人型机器人与使徒战斗。本已表示拒绝的真嗣，看到重伤的替补驾驶员绫波丽后，决定遵从父亲的命令。就这样，从未受过作战训练的真嗣，准备驾驶EVA初号机迎战使徒。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-10-30 11:45:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":30,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/negnJ83d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmYZ8rb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqlx6Ga/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7ax2kLqd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/6dBPB9Na/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QdJN6WPd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dNYkWpb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdRP6jKa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QbYyEqnb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Le3y1Vxb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xe7p3Vra/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/negnJM3d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmYZNrb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqlxLGa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/negnJXYd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmYZXOb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqlx82a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"http